{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-8513","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8326","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8327","text":" -- Semantic Vector Retrieval Capability"}]},{"id":"blk-8514","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8328","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8329","text":" is a concrete capability page for the [&] Protocol's "},{"id":"spn-8330","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory"},{"id":"spn-8331","text":" primitive."}]},{"id":"blk-8515","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8332","text":"It describes the capability interface for "},{"id":"spn-8333","marks":["bold"],"text":"semantic vector retrieval"},{"id":"spn-8334","text":": a memory system that embeds documents and knowledge corpora into vector space and retrieves them by similarity. This is the canonical approach for corpus-level semantic search, knowledge-base lookup, and context enrichment over large unstructured or semi-structured document sets."}]},{"id":"blk-8516","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8335","text":"This page is part of the capability registry and documentation hub. It is intended to be useful both to humans and to downstream generation systems."}]},{"id":"blk-8517","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8336","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8518","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8337","text":"1. Definition"}]},{"id":"blk-8519","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8338","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8339","text":" is the capability for:"}]},{"id":"blk-8520","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8522","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8340","text":"semantic similarity retrieval over embedded documents"}]}],"id":"blk-8521","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8524","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8341","text":"corpus-level knowledge-base lookup"}]}],"id":"blk-8523","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8526","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8342","text":"context enrichment with semantically relevant material"}]}],"id":"blk-8525","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8528","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8343","text":"inserting and updating embedded documents for future retrieval"}]}],"id":"blk-8527","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8529","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8344","text":"Unlike graph memory, vector memory operates over a "},{"id":"spn-8345","marks":["bold"],"text":"flat embedding space"},{"id":"spn-8346","text":". There is no explicit relationship structure. Retrieval is based on proximity in vector space: what is semantically similar to the query, not what is structurally connected."}]},{"id":"blk-8530","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8347","text":"That makes it especially useful when an agent must answer questions like:"}]},{"id":"blk-8531","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8533","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8348","text":"What documents in this corpus are most relevant to this query?"}]}],"id":"blk-8532","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8535","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8349","text":"Which support articles best match this customer question?"}]}],"id":"blk-8534","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8537","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8350","text":"What prior research material is semantically closest to this claim?"}]}],"id":"blk-8536","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8539","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8351","text":"What context should be injected to ground this response?"}]}],"id":"blk-8538","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8540","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8352","text":"In protocol terms, the canonical capability identifier is:"}]},{"id":"blk-8541","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8543","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8353","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"}]}],"id":"blk-8542","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8544","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8354","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8545","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8355","text":"2. Why this capability exists"}]},{"id":"blk-8546","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8356","text":"A large share of important agent workloads involve retrieval over document corpora that do not have explicit relational structure. The documents exist as text, and the retrieval problem is: find what is semantically relevant."}]},{"id":"blk-8547","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8357","text":"Examples:"}]},{"id":"blk-8548","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8550","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8358","text":"support knowledge bases where articles must be matched to customer questions"}]}],"id":"blk-8549","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8552","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8359","text":"research corpora where papers, notes, and claims must be surfaced by meaning"}]}],"id":"blk-8551","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8554","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8360","text":"policy and compliance libraries where the right section must be found for a given situation"}]}],"id":"blk-8553","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8556","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8361","text":"product documentation where the answer to a technical question lives somewhere in a large set of pages"}]}],"id":"blk-8555","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8557","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8362","text":"A vector retrieval capability is useful whenever:"}]},{"id":"blk-8558","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8363","text":"1. the corpus is large enough that keyword search alone is insufficient 2. retrieval should be based on meaning, not just exact terms 3. the agent needs grounded context from a knowledge base before reasoning 4. documents should be retrievable without requiring manual tagging or graph construction"}]},{"id":"blk-8559","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8364","text":"This is why "},{"id":"spn-8365","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8366","text":" is a distinct capability rather than just a provider detail."}]},{"id":"blk-8560","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8367","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8561","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8368","text":"3. Capability family position"}]},{"id":"blk-8562","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8369","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8370","text":" sits inside the "},{"id":"spn-8371","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory"},{"id":"spn-8372","text":" namespace."}]},{"id":"blk-8563","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8373","text":"Related memory capabilities include:"}]},{"id":"blk-8564","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8566","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8374","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8375","text":" -- graph-structured relationship memory"}]}],"id":"blk-8565","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8568","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8376","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.episodic"},{"id":"spn-8377","text":" -- replayable prior experiences or sessions"}]}],"id":"blk-8567","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8569","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8378","text":"A useful shorthand:"}]},{"id":"blk-8570","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8572","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8379","marks":["code"],"text":"memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8380","text":" = semantic similarity retrieval"}]}],"id":"blk-8571","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8574","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8381","marks":["code"],"text":"memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8382","text":" = connected durable knowledge"}]}],"id":"blk-8573","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8576","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8383","marks":["code"],"text":"memory.episodic"},{"id":"spn-8384","text":" = prior experience replay"}]}],"id":"blk-8575","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8577","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8385","text":"How these differ in practice:"}]},{"id":"blk-8578","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8580","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8386","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8387","text":" finds what is "},{"id":"spn-8388","marks":["bold"],"text":"similar"},{"id":"spn-8389","text":". It operates over embeddings in a flat space. There is no topology, no edges, no relationship structure. Results are ranked by distance."}]}],"id":"blk-8579","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8582","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8390","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8391","text":" finds what is "},{"id":"spn-8392","marks":["bold"],"text":"connected"},{"id":"spn-8393","text":". It operates over nodes and edges. It can traverse dependency chains, identify feedback loops, and use kappa-aware routing to decide whether cyclic structure requires deliberation."}]}],"id":"blk-8581","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8584","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8394","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.episodic"},{"id":"spn-8395","text":" finds what "},{"id":"spn-8396","marks":["bold"],"text":"happened before"},{"id":"spn-8397","text":". It stores session-level history and replayable experience. It is scoped to temporal sequences, not corpus-level knowledge."}]}],"id":"blk-8583","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8585","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8398","text":"In many real systems, these capabilities compose rather than compete."}]},{"id":"blk-8586","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8399","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8587","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8400","text":"4. Capability contract summary"}]},{"id":"blk-8588","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8401","text":"Below is a representative contract for "},{"id":"spn-8402","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8403","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-8589","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8404","text":"~~~json { \"$schema\": \"https://protocol.ampersandboxdesign.com/schema/v0.1.0/capability-contract.schema.json\", \"capability\": \"&memory.vector\", \"provider\": \"pgvector\", \"version\": \"0.1.0\", \"description\": \"Semantic vector retrieval contract for similarity search, document upsert, and context enrichment over embedded knowledge corpora.\", \"operations\": { \"search\": { \"in\": \"query_context\", \"out\": \"retrieval_hits\", \"description\": \"Retrieve semantically similar documents from the vector store given a query context.\", \"deterministic\": false, \"side_effects\": false }, \"upsert\": { \"in\": \"document_payload\", \"out\": \"ack\", \"description\": \"Insert or update an embedded document in the vector store.\", \"deterministic\": true, \"side_effects\": true }, \"enrich\": { \"in\": \"query_context\", \"out\": \"enriched_context\", \"description\": \"Augment an existing context object with semantically relevant material from the corpus.\", \"deterministic\": false, \"side_effects\": false } }, \"accepts_from\": [ \"&reason.*\", \"&memory.episodic\", \"query_context\", \"document_payload\" ], \"feeds_into\": [ \"&reason.*\", \"&memory.graph\", \"output\" ], \"a2a_skills\": [ \"semantic-retrieval\", \"knowledge-base-enrichment\" ] } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8590","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8405","text":"Interpretation"}]},{"id":"blk-8591","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8406","text":"This contract says that "},{"id":"spn-8407","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8408","text":" can:"}]},{"id":"blk-8592","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8594","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8409","text":"search for semantically similar documents from a query context"}]}],"id":"blk-8593","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8596","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8410","text":"upsert new or updated documents into the vector store"}]}],"id":"blk-8595","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8598","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8411","text":"enrich an existing context with relevant semantic material for downstream use"}]}],"id":"blk-8597","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8599","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8412","text":"It also says that it composes especially naturally with:"}]},{"id":"blk-8600","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8602","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8413","text":"reasoning capabilities downstream"}]}],"id":"blk-8601","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8604","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8414","text":"graph memory downstream (for hybrid retrieval)"}]}],"id":"blk-8603","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8606","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8415","text":"episodic memory upstream (to ground retrieval in session context)"}]}],"id":"blk-8605","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8607","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8416","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8608","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8417","text":"5. Operations"}]},{"id":"blk-8609","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8418","marks":["code"],"text":"search"}]},{"id":"blk-8610","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8419","text":"Purpose:"}]},{"id":"blk-8611","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8613","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8420","text":"retrieve documents or passages that are semantically similar to the query"}]}],"id":"blk-8612","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8614","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8421","text":"Typical input:"}]},{"id":"blk-8615","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8617","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8422","marks":["code"],"text":"query_context"}]}],"id":"blk-8616","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8618","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8423","text":"Typical output:"}]},{"id":"blk-8619","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8621","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8424","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieval_hits"}]}],"id":"blk-8620","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8622","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8425","text":"Use when:"}]},{"id":"blk-8623","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8625","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8426","text":"the agent needs to find relevant material from a corpus based on meaning"}]}],"id":"blk-8624","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8626","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8427","marks":["code"],"text":"upsert"}]},{"id":"blk-8627","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8428","text":"Purpose:"}]},{"id":"blk-8628","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8630","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8429","text":"insert a new document or update an existing one in the vector store"}]}],"id":"blk-8629","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8631","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8430","text":"Typical input:"}]},{"id":"blk-8632","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8634","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8431","marks":["code"],"text":"document_payload"}]}],"id":"blk-8633","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8635","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8432","text":"Typical output:"}]},{"id":"blk-8636","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8638","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8433","marks":["code"],"text":"ack"}]}],"id":"blk-8637","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8639","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8434","text":"Use when:"}]},{"id":"blk-8640","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8642","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8435","text":"the agent should add or refresh knowledge in the corpus"}]}],"id":"blk-8641","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8643","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8436","marks":["code"],"text":"enrich"}]},{"id":"blk-8644","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8437","text":"Purpose:"}]},{"id":"blk-8645","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8647","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8438","text":"augment an existing context object with semantically relevant material from the corpus"}]}],"id":"blk-8646","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8648","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8439","text":"Typical input:"}]},{"id":"blk-8649","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8651","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8440","marks":["code"],"text":"query_context"},{"id":"spn-8441","text":" or compatible context object"}]}],"id":"blk-8650","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8652","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8442","text":"Typical output:"}]},{"id":"blk-8653","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8655","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8443","marks":["code"],"text":"enriched_context"}]}],"id":"blk-8654","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8656","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8444","text":"Use when:"}]},{"id":"blk-8657","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8659","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8445","text":"another capability has already produced a signal and semantic context should make it more useful"}]}],"id":"blk-8658","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8660","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8446","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8661","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8447","text":"6. Architecture patterns"}]},{"id":"blk-8662","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8448","text":"Pattern A: policy-grounded support"}]},{"id":"blk-8663","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8449","text":"~~~text customer_query"}]},{"id":"blk-8664","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8450","text":"~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8665","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8451","text":"What happens:"}]},{"id":"blk-8666","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8452","text":"1. vector memory retrieves relevant support articles and policy documents 2. episodic memory adds prior session context for this customer 3. reasoning evaluates the best response grounded in policy"}]},{"id":"blk-8667","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8453","text":"This is one of the strongest "},{"id":"spn-8454","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8455","text":" patterns for customer-facing agents."}]},{"id":"blk-8668","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8456","text":"Pattern B: hybrid retrieval"}]},{"id":"blk-8669","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8457","text":"~~~text research_query"}]},{"id":"blk-8670","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8458","text":"~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8671","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8459","text":"What happens:"}]},{"id":"blk-8672","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8460","text":"1. vector memory retrieves semantically relevant documents 2. graph memory adds relationship and dependency context 3. reasoning synthesizes evidence from both retrieval modes"}]},{"id":"blk-8673","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8461","text":"This combines breadth (vector) with structure (graph)."}]},{"id":"blk-8674","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8462","text":"Pattern C: corpus ingestion"}]},{"id":"blk-8675","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8463","text":"~~~text new_document"}]},{"id":"blk-8676","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8464","text":"~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8677","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8465","text":"What happens:"}]},{"id":"blk-8678","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8466","text":"1. the document is embedded and stored for future retrieval"}]},{"id":"blk-8679","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8467","text":"This is the write path. It keeps the corpus current."}]},{"id":"blk-8680","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8468","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8681","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8469","text":"7. Architecture diagram"}]},{"id":"blk-8682","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8470","text":"A simple mental model for "},{"id":"spn-8471","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8472","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-8683","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8473","text":"~~~text +---------------------+"}]},{"id":"blk-8684","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8474","text":"+---------+-----------+"}]},{"id":"blk-8685","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8475","text":"v +---------------------+"}]},{"id":"blk-8686","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8476","text":"+---------+-----------+"}]},{"id":"blk-8687","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8477","text":"+--------------+--------------+"}]},{"id":"blk-8688","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8478","text":"v              v              v +----------------+ +------------+ +---------------+"}]},{"id":"blk-8689","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8479","text":"+------+---------+ +------------+ +---------------+"}]},{"id":"blk-8690","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8480","text":"v +---------------------+"}]},{"id":"blk-8691","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8481","text":"+---------------------+ ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8692","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8482","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8693","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8483","text":"8. Example declaration"}]},{"id":"blk-8694","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8484","text":"A concrete "},{"id":"spn-8485","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-8486","text":" fragment:"}]},{"id":"blk-8695","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8487","text":"~~~json { \"&memory.vector\": { \"provider\": \"pgvector\", \"config\": { \"instance\": \"support-kb\" } } } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8696","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8488","text":"A fuller declaration ("},{"id":"spn-8489","marks":["code"],"text":"customer-support.ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-8490","text":"):"}]},{"id":"blk-8697","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8491","text":"~~~json { \"$schema\": \"https://protocol.ampersandboxdesign.com/schema/v0.1.0/ampersand.schema.json\", \"agent\": \"SupportAgent\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\", \"capabilities\": { \"&memory.vector\": { \"provider\": \"pgvector\", \"config\": { \"instance\": \"support-kb\" } }, \"&memory.episodic\": { \"provider\": \"default\", \"config\": { \"session_scope\": \"customer\" } }, \"&reason.argument\": { \"provider\": \"deliberatic\", \"config\": { \"governance\": \"standard\" } } }, \"provenance\": true } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8698","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8492","text":"A research-oriented declaration ("},{"id":"spn-8493","marks":["code"],"text":"research-agent.ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-8494","text":"):"}]},{"id":"blk-8699","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8495","text":"~~~json { \"$schema\": \"https://protocol.ampersandboxdesign.com/schema/v0.1.0/ampersand.schema.json\", \"agent\": \"ResearchAgent\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\", \"capabilities\": { \"&memory.vector\": { \"provider\": \"weaviate\", \"config\": { \"instance\": \"research-corpus\" } }, \"&memory.graph\": { \"provider\": \"graphonomous\", \"config\": { \"instance\": \"research-kg\" } }, \"&reason.argument\": { \"provider\": \"deliberatic\", \"config\": { \"governance\": \"constitutional\" } } }, \"provenance\": true } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8700","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8496","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8701","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8497","text":"9. Example API shape"}]},{"id":"blk-8702","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8498","text":"A provider-specific API may vary, but the protocol-level shape can look like this."}]},{"id":"blk-8703","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8499","text":"Search request"}]},{"id":"blk-8704","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8500","text":"~~~json { \"capability\": \"&memory.vector\", \"operation\": \"search\", \"input\": { \"query_context\": { \"query\": \"how to reset account password after lockout\", \"top_k\": 5 } } } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8705","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8501","text":"Search response"}]},{"id":"blk-8706","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8502","text":"~~~json { \"capability\": \"&memory.vector\", \"operation\": \"search\", \"output\": { \"retrieval_hits\": [ { \"document_id\": \"kb-article-2041\", \"title\": \"Account lockout recovery procedure\", \"score\": 0.94, \"snippet\": \"When an account is locked after repeated failed login attempts...\" }, { \"document_id\": \"kb-article-1893\", \"title\": \"Password reset flow for enterprise accounts\", \"score\": 0.87, \"snippet\": \"Enterprise accounts use a separate reset pathway...\" } ] } } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8707","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8503","text":"Enrich request"}]},{"id":"blk-8708","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8504","text":"~~~json { \"capability\": \"&memory.vector\", \"operation\": \"enrich\", \"input\": { \"query_context\": { \"query\": \"customer reports inability to access dashboard after migration\", \"top_k\": 3 } } } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8709","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8505","text":"Enrich response"}]},{"id":"blk-8710","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8506","text":"~~~json { \"capability\": \"&memory.vector\", \"operation\": \"enrich\", \"output\": { \"enriched_context\": { \"relevant_articles\": [ \"kb-article-3102\", \"kb-article-2891\" ], \"relevant_policies\": [ \"migration-access-policy-v2\" ], \"semantic_summary\": \"Two knowledge base articles and one migration policy document are relevant to post-migration dashboard access issues.\" } } } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8711","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8507","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8712","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8508","text":"10. Compatible providers"}]},{"id":"blk-8713","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8509","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8510","text":" is a capability interface. Compatible providers are implementations that can satisfy the contract."}]},{"id":"blk-8714","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8511","text":"Representative providers:"}]},{"id":"blk-8715","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8717","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8512","marks":["code"],"text":"pgvector"},{"id":"spn-8513","text":" (default)"}]}],"id":"blk-8716","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8719","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8514","marks":["code"],"text":"weaviate"}]}],"id":"blk-8718","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8721","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8515","text":"custom embedding-backed retrieval services wrapped behind a protocol-compatible surface"}]}],"id":"blk-8720","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8723","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8516","text":"managed vector database services with a compatible API shape"}]}],"id":"blk-8722","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8724","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8517","text":"Current default ecosystem fit"}]},{"id":"blk-8725","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8727","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8518","marks":["code"],"text":"pgvector"},{"id":"spn-8519","text":" is the default provider in this repository"}]}],"id":"blk-8726","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8728","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8520","text":"Why it fits:"}]},{"id":"blk-8729","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8731","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8521","text":"widely deployed and operationally simple"}]}],"id":"blk-8730","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8733","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8522","text":"embeds directly into PostgreSQL infrastructure many teams already run"}]}],"id":"blk-8732","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8735","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8523","text":"suitable for search, upsert, and enrichment workflows"}]}],"id":"blk-8734","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8737","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8524","text":"no separate cluster required for moderate-scale corpora"}]}],"id":"blk-8736","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8738","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8525","text":"Alternative provider: Weaviate"}]},{"id":"blk-8739","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8526","text":"Why it fits:"}]},{"id":"blk-8740","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8742","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8527","text":"purpose-built for vector search at scale"}]}],"id":"blk-8741","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8744","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8528","text":"supports hybrid search (vector + keyword)"}]}],"id":"blk-8743","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8746","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8529","text":"suitable for larger corpora or workloads requiring dedicated vector infrastructure"}]}],"id":"blk-8745","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8747","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8530","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8748","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8531","text":"11. A2A-facing skills"}]},{"id":"blk-8749","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8532","text":"A "},{"id":"spn-8533","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8534","text":" capability may advertise skills such as:"}]},{"id":"blk-8750","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8752","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8535","marks":["code"],"text":"semantic-retrieval"}]}],"id":"blk-8751","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8754","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8536","marks":["code"],"text":"knowledge-base-enrichment"}]}],"id":"blk-8753","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8755","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8537","text":"These skills are useful when generating A2A agent cards from a declaration, because they let an externally visible agent surface say more than just \"has memory.\" A downstream agent or orchestrator can discover that this agent offers semantic retrieval as a specific skill."}]},{"id":"blk-8756","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8538","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8757","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8539","text":"12. Governance implications"}]},{"id":"blk-8758","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8540","text":"Vector retrieval often serves as the grounding layer for agent responses, so governance matters."}]},{"id":"blk-8759","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8541","text":"Examples of governance constraints that commonly pair with "},{"id":"spn-8542","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8543","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-8760","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8544","text":"Hard constraints"}]},{"id":"blk-8761","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8763","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8545","text":"never return restricted or access-controlled documents outside authorized workflows"}]}],"id":"blk-8762","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8765","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8546","text":"never surface confidential knowledge-base content to unauthorized callers"}]}],"id":"blk-8764","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8767","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8547","text":"always preserve audit trail for retrieval-grounded decision support"}]}],"id":"blk-8766","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8768","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8548","text":"Soft constraints"}]},{"id":"blk-8769","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8771","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8549","text":"prefer higher-confidence retrieval hits when multiple results are available"}]}],"id":"blk-8770","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8773","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8550","text":"prefer recent documents when relevance scores are similar"}]}],"id":"blk-8772","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8775","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8551","text":"prefer policy-tagged documents over untagged material in compliance-sensitive domains"}]}],"id":"blk-8774","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8776","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8552","text":"Escalation triggers"}]},{"id":"blk-8777","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8779","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8553","text":"escalate when no retrieval hits meet the minimum relevance threshold"}]}],"id":"blk-8778","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8781","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8554","text":"escalate when retrieved material conflicts with known policy"}]}],"id":"blk-8780","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8782","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8555","text":"Standard retrieval governance applies: the governance mode for "},{"id":"spn-8556","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8557","text":" is straightforward compared to graph or reasoning capabilities, because the operation is read-heavy and the primary risk is surfacing wrong or restricted content rather than taking irreversible action."}]},{"id":"blk-8783","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8558","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8784","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8559","text":"13. Provenance implications"}]},{"id":"blk-8785","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8560","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8561","text":" should participate in the provenance chain."}]},{"id":"blk-8786","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8562","text":"Representative provenance record:"}]},{"id":"blk-8787","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8563","text":"~~~json { \"source\": \"&memory.vector\", \"provider\": \"pgvector\", \"operation\": \"search\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-14T14:23:07Z\", \"input_hash\": \"sha256:3e4f...\", \"output_hash\": \"sha256:9a1b...\", \"parent_hash\": \"sha256:0000...\" } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8788","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8564","text":"This matters because vector retrieval results often directly ground downstream reasoning. If an agent responds to a customer based on a retrieved article, or if a research agent cites a retrieved paper, the retrieval step should be auditable. Provenance makes it possible to trace which documents were surfaced and when."}]},{"id":"blk-8789","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8565","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8790","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8566","text":"14. Typical use cases"}]},{"id":"blk-8791","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8567","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8568","text":" is especially strong in the following domains."}]},{"id":"blk-8792","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8569","text":"Customer support"}]},{"id":"blk-8793","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8795","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8570","text":"knowledge-base article retrieval for customer questions"}]}],"id":"blk-8794","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8797","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8571","text":"policy document lookup for escalation decisions"}]}],"id":"blk-8796","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8799","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8572","text":"grounding agent responses in approved content"}]}],"id":"blk-8798","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8800","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8573","text":"Research systems"}]},{"id":"blk-8801","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8803","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8574","text":"corpus-level semantic search over papers, notes, and claims"}]}],"id":"blk-8802","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8805","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8575","text":"literature retrieval for evidence synthesis"}]}],"id":"blk-8804","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8807","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8576","text":"semantic matching of new findings against prior work"}]}],"id":"blk-8806","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8808","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8577","text":"Compliance and policy"}]},{"id":"blk-8809","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8811","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8578","text":"regulatory document retrieval"}]}],"id":"blk-8810","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8813","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8579","text":"policy section lookup for audit or review workflows"}]}],"id":"blk-8812","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8815","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8580","text":"grounding decisions in authoritative source material"}]}],"id":"blk-8814","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8816","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8581","text":"General agent grounding"}]},{"id":"blk-8817","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8819","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8582","text":"semantic context enrichment before reasoning"}]}],"id":"blk-8818","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8821","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8583","text":"document retrieval for RAG (retrieval-augmented generation) pipelines"}]}],"id":"blk-8820","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8823","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8584","text":"knowledge-base maintenance through upsert workflows"}]}],"id":"blk-8822","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8824","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8585","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8825","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8586","text":"15. Anti-patterns"}]},{"id":"blk-8826","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8587","text":"Avoid these mistakes when modeling "},{"id":"spn-8588","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8589","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-8827","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8590","text":"Anti-pattern 1: treating vector retrieval as relationship-aware"}]},{"id":"blk-8828","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8591","text":"Vector memory finds what is similar in embedding space. It does not know how things connect. If relationship structure matters, use "},{"id":"spn-8592","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8593","text":" instead or alongside."}]},{"id":"blk-8829","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8594","text":"Anti-pattern 2: collapsing provider and capability"}]},{"id":"blk-8830","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8595","marks":["code"],"text":"pgvector"},{"id":"spn-8596","text":" is not the protocol capability. "},{"id":"spn-8597","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8598","text":" is."}]},{"id":"blk-8831","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8599","text":"Anti-pattern 3: using vector retrieval without provenance"}]},{"id":"blk-8832","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8600","text":"If retrieved content influences action, the retrieval step should be preserved in the provenance chain."}]},{"id":"blk-8833","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8601","text":"Anti-pattern 4: using vector memory as the only memory capability"}]},{"id":"blk-8834","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8602","text":"Vector retrieval is strong for corpus search but does not replace session history ("},{"id":"spn-8603","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.episodic"},{"id":"spn-8604","text":") or structured relationship memory ("},{"id":"spn-8605","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8606","text":"). In many systems, "},{"id":"spn-8607","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8608","text":" works best as one layer in a multi-memory architecture."}]},{"id":"blk-8835","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8609","text":"Anti-pattern 5: assuming embedding quality is uniform"}]},{"id":"blk-8836","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8610","text":"Different embedding models produce different quality results for different domains. The capability abstraction is stable, but provider configuration (embedding model, chunking strategy, distance metric) affects retrieval quality significantly."}]},{"id":"blk-8837","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8611","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8838","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8612","text":"16. Related capabilities"}]},{"id":"blk-8839","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8613","text":"Closest related protocol capabilities:"}]},{"id":"blk-8840","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8842","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8614","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"}]}],"id":"blk-8841","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8844","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8615","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.episodic"}]}],"id":"blk-8843","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8846","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8616","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.argument"}]}],"id":"blk-8845","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8847","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8617","text":"Common high-value compositions:"}]},{"id":"blk-8848","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8850","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8618","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8619","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-8620","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.episodic"},{"id":"spn-8621","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-8622","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.argument"},{"id":"spn-8623","text":" (policy-grounded support)"}]}],"id":"blk-8849","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8852","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8624","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8625","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-8626","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8627","text":" (hybrid retrieval)"}]}],"id":"blk-8851","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8854","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8628","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8629","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-8630","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.argument"},{"id":"spn-8631","text":" (grounded reasoning over retrieved evidence)"}]}],"id":"blk-8853","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8855","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8632","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8856","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8633","text":"17. Research references"}]},{"id":"blk-8857","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8634","text":"This capability is informed by both information retrieval research and modern retrieval-augmented generation architecture."}]},{"id":"blk-8858","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8635","text":"Useful reference directions:"}]},{"id":"blk-8859","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8861","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8636","text":"dense passage retrieval and bi-encoder models"}]}],"id":"blk-8860","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8863","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8637","text":"approximate nearest neighbor search (HNSW, IVF, product quantization)"}]}],"id":"blk-8862","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8865","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8638","text":"retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) systems"}]}],"id":"blk-8864","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8867","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8639","text":"hybrid search combining vector and keyword retrieval"}]}],"id":"blk-8866","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8869","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8640","text":"embedding model evaluation and domain adaptation"}]}],"id":"blk-8868","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8871","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8641","text":"vector database architecture and scaling patterns"}]}],"id":"blk-8870","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8873","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8642","text":"chunking and document segmentation strategies for retrieval quality"}]}],"id":"blk-8872","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8874","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8643","text":"The protocol does not prescribe a specific embedding model or retrieval algorithm. The value of this capability is in 